<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44559" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔνομ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>under good laws, well-ordered</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					5(4).22
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				20a
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκύθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					198
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνδρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					815b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολιτεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Zeno Stoic.
					1.27
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of
			things, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρανος -ώτατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					1.37
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοῖρα εὔ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐνομία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>N.</u>
				9.29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νομή</span>) of places, <i>good for pasture</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Longus
				4.4
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			).</div>
